                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "41a1e01d-c7b2-4196-9b73-f012671f18f6",
                                                "sense_id": "086421f0-a03d-343a-8b0f-9c60725e2de6",
                                                "text": "\"Seems we were all living bad dreams,\" he said. \"Wishes coming true in a monkey-paw way.\""
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "05aea4c5-7ebf-474c-9291-3b03eee87dd7",
                                                "sense_id": "086421f0-a03d-343a-8b0f-9c60725e2de6",
                                                "text": "It was Tom's monkey paw, that wish that he could be the provider in the family. Suddenly my father was dead and the gauntlet was passed to my oldest brother."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e5ae7abb-fe10-407e-bd79-c6134fa1f68b",
                                                "sense_id": "086421f0-a03d-343a-8b0f-9c60725e2de6",
                                                "text": "For obvious reasons, I didn't trust demon favors. I had to think quickly, something that wouldn't backfire. There was a lesson to be learned from that whole monkey paw deal."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
